it, PCRE2_NO_START_OPTIMIZE, optimization_flags) — differences from pcre2_match.c.\n\n(F) Recursion/heap in DFA: `PCRE2_ERROR_NOMEMORY` paths, `match_limit`/`depth_limit`/`heap_limit` usage (which of them the DFA actually honours), `pcre2_set_recursion_memory_management` relevance, internal `RWS` (recursive workspace) growth, and the `internal_dfa_match` recursion depth.\n\n(G) Callouts in DFA: what fields differ from pcre2_match, and whether auto-callout works.\n\n(H) UTF handling: invalid UTF detection, PCRE2_MATCH_INVALID_UTF support (supported or rejected?), start_offset in the middle of a multi-byte char (`PCRE2_ERROR_BADUTFOFFSET`).\n\nBe precise with line numbers. Output as compact structured text, no files.","uuid":"3c95b5bf-4a03-4cfe-8c22-2369efd000c5","session_id":"aeab5d90-512d-4436-80fd-a67670a151c9"}
