5, 935-936 | dotted/dotless I casing via `ucd_turkish_dotted_i_caseset` | `(?i)i` | **ERR104** if !UTF && !UCP; **ERR105** if 8-bit && !UTF; **ERR106** if + CASELESS_RESTRICT |\n\n---\n\n# (B) EXPORTED INTERNALS — VERBATIM DECLARATIONS\n\n**`_pcre2_check_escape`** — decl `pcre2_internal.h:2323-2324`, macro `:2297`; definition `pcre2_compile.c:1489-1492`:\n```c\nextern int          _pcre2_check_escape(PCRE2_SPTR *, PCRE2_SPTR, uint32_t *,\n                      int *, uint32_t, uint32_t, uint32_t, BOOL, compile_block *);\n/* def: PRIV(check_escape)(PCRE2_SPTR *ptrptr, PCRE2_SPTR ptrend, uint32_t *chptr,\n   int *errorcodeptr, uint32_t options, uint32_t xoptions, uint32_t bracount,\n   BOOL isclass, compile_block *cb) */\n```\ncb fields read: `cb->external_flags` (|= PCRE2_HASBKPORX, 1540). `cb` may be **NULL** (called that way from `pcre2_substitute.c`), which restricts recognition to `\\0-\\9 \\c \\o \\x \\g` (1613-1621) and forces `alt_bsux=FALSE`. Reachable standalone with `cb=NULL`; otherwise needs only a zeroed `compile_block`.\n\n**`_pcre2_compile_class_not_nested`** — `pcre2_compile.h:309-311`; def `pcre2_compile_class.c:1071-1074`:\n```c\nuint32_t *PRIV(compile_class_not_nested)(uint32_t options, uint32_t xoptions,\n  uint32_t *start_ptr, PCRE2_UCHAR **pcode, BOOL negate_class, BOOL* has_bitmap,\n  int *errorcodeptr, compile_block *cb, PCRE2_SIZE *lengthptr);\n```\ncb fields: `cb->cbits` (1080), `cb->classbits.classbits` (1083 — scratch bitmap, **must** be the cb's own), `cb->char_lists_size`, `cb->cx->memctl`, `cb->first_data`/`last_data` (class_ranges cache list), `cb->erroroffset`, `cb->lcc`/`fcc` (via `add_to_class`). Input is a **parsed-pattern (META) stream**, not text — caller must run `parse_regex` first. Called from `pcre2_compile.c:6459`.\n\n**`_pcre2_compile_class_nested`** — `pcre2_compile.h:318-320`; def `pcre2_compile_class.c:2571-2575`:\n```c\nBOOL PRIV(compile_class_nested)(uint32_t options, uint32_t xoptions,\n  uint32_t **pptr, PCRE2_UCHAR **pcode, int *errorcodeptr,\n  compile_block *cb, PCRE2_SIZE *lengthptr);\n```\nRequires `**pptr == (META_CLASS|CLASS_IS_ECLASS)` or `(META_CLASS_NOT|CLASS_IS_ECLASS)` (asserted 2557-2558). Same cb fields plus `cb->class_op_used[ECLASS_NEST_LIMIT]`. Called from `pcre2_compile.c:6333`. Emits `OP_ECLASS` + LINK_SIZE + flags then constant-folds; may unwrap to a plain class (2618ff).\n\n**`_pcre2_compile_get_hash_from_name`** — `pcre2_compile.h:326`; def `pcre2_compile_cgroup.c:58-68`:\n```c\nuint16_t PRIV(compile_get_hash_from_name)(PCRE2_SPTR name, uint32_t length);\n```\n**No cb.** Pure: `(name[0] & 0x7f) | ((name[length-1] & 0xff) << 7)`, masked by `NAMED_GROUP_HASH_MASK` (0x7fff, `pcre2_compile.h:294`). Directly callable.\n\n**`_pcre2_compile_find_named_group`** — `pcre2_compile.h:330-331`; def `pcre2_compile_cgroup.c:86-101`:\n```c\nnamed_group *PRIV(compile_find_named_group)(PCRE2_SPTR name,\n  uint32_t length, compile_block *cb);\n```\ncb fields: `cb->named_groups`, `cb->names_found`.\n\n**`_pcre2_compile_add_name_to_table`** — `pcre2_compile.h:335-336`; def `pcre2_compile_cgroup.c:118-121`:\n```c\nuint32_t PRIV(compile_add_name_to_table)(compile_block *cb,\n  named_group *ng, uint32_t tablecount);\n```\ncb fields: `cb->name_table` (write target, must point into the allocated `pcre2_real_code`), `cb->name_entry_size`, `cb->named_groups`, `cb->names_found`. Called only between passes, `pcre2_compile.c:10951`.\n\n**`_pcre2_compile_find_dupname_details`** — `pcre2_compile.h:341-342`; def `pcre2_compile_cgroup.c:211-214`:\n```c\nBOOL PRIV(compile_find_dupname_details)(PCRE2_SPTR name, uint32_t length,\n  int *indexptr, int *countptr, int *errorcodeptr, compile_block *cb);\n```\ncb fields read: `cb->name_table`, `cb->names_found`, `cb->name_entry_size`, `cb->start_pattern`; **written**: `cb->backref_map |= …` (403), `cb->top_backref` (404), `cb->erroroffset`. Requires the real (post-pass-1) name table.\n\n**`_pcre2_compile_parse_scan_substr_args`** — `pcre2_compile.h:346-347`; def `pcre2_compile_cgroup.c:361-364`:\n```c\nuint32_t * PRIV(compile_parse_scan_substr_args)(uint32_t *pptr,\n  int *errorcodeptr, compile_block *cb, PCRE2_SIZE *lengthptr);\n```\nAsserts `*pptr == META_OFFSET` (374). cb fields: `cb->bracount` (bitmap size 380), `cb->cx->memctl` (malloc/free), `cb->named_groups`, `cb->names_found`, `cb->erroroffset`. **Writes `*lengthptr` unconditionally** — must not be NULL. Reached only via `(*scan_substring:…)`.\n\n**`_pcre2_compile_parse_recurse_args`** — `pcre2_compile.h:351-352`; def `pcre2_compile_cgroup.c:506-509`:\n```c\nBOOL PRIV(compile_parse_recurse_args)(uint32_t *pptr_start,\n  PCRE2_SIZE offset, int *errorcodeptr, compile_block *cb);\n```\ncb fields: `cb->named_groups`, `cb->names_found`, `cb->cx->memctl`, `cb->first_data`/`cb->last_data` (appends a `recurse_arguments` to the cache list — caller owns freeing), `cb->erroroffset`. Reached via `(?1(a,b))` / `(?&name(...))` argument lists.\n\n**`_pcre2_update_classbits`** — `pcre2_compile.h:303-304`; def `pcre2_compile_class.c:751-752`:\n```c\nvoid PRIV(update_classbits)(uint32_t ptype, uint32_t pdata, BOOL negated,\n  uint8_t *classbits);\n```\n**No cb** — takes the bitmap directly. `SUPPORT_UNICODE`-only (guarded at 749). Directly callable; note the comment \"Update `PRIV(xclass)` when this function is changed\" (754).\n\n**`_pcre2_eclass`** — decl `pcre2_internal.h:2349-2350`, macro `:2319`; def `pcre2_xclass.c:461-463` (**match-time**, not in the four compile files):\n```c\nextern BOOL         _pcre2_eclass(uint32_t, PCRE2_SPTR, PCRE2_SPTR,\n                      const uint8_t *, BOOL);\n/* def: PRIV(eclass)(uint32_t c, PCRE2_SPTR data_start, PCRE2_SPTR data_end,\n   const uint8_t *char_lists_end, BOOL utf) */\n```\nNo cb. Consumes the `OP_ECLASS` operand written by `_pcre2_compile_class_nested`; asserts `data_start < data_end` and (if `ECL_MAP`) ≥32 bytes of bitmap.\n\nAlso note `extern const int PRIV(posix_class_maps)[]` (`pcre2_compile.h:290`, defined `pcre2_compile.c:645-661`).\n\n---\n\n# (C) DISTINCT PARSER / CODEGEN BRANCHES\n\nParser = `parse_regex` (**3112-5966**); codegen = `compile_branch` (**6068-8573**) + `compile_regex` (**8575-8894**).\n\n**Groups / captures**\n- capture `(a)` — 4728-4744 (`META_CAPTURE`), codegen 8251-8258\n- non-capture `(?:a)` — 5160 (`META_NOCAPTURE`), codegen 6907\n- `(?|a|b)` branch reset — 4996-5018, sets `PCRE2_DUPCAPUSED` (5016); alt reset 5820-5834\n- named `(?<n>a)` / `(?'n'a)` / `(?P<n>a)` — 5633-5642 → `DEFINE_NAME` 5688-5801; `(?P<` 5180-5184\n- dup names `(?J)(?<a>x)(?<a>y)` — 5736-5758\n- **>255 / >65535 captures**: `cb->bracount >= MAX_GROUP_NUMBER` at **4735-4739** and **5696-5700** → **ERR97**. Distinct codegen at 6689 (`groupnumber > MAX_GROUP_NUMBER`).\n\n**Backrefs** — numeric `\\1` (check_escape 1863-1928 → negative return; codegen 8136-8180 `HANDLE_SINGLE_REFERENCE` 8157); relative `\\g{-1}` 1767-1810; `\\g{name}`/`\\k<n>`/`\\k'n'`/`\\k{n}` 3743-3792 (terminator selection 3751-3753; `{` ⇒ BACKREF, `<`/`'` ⇒ RECURSE, 3785-3787); `(?P=n)` 5192-5204. Codegen `META_BACKREF_BYNAME` 7122ff; dup → `OP_DNREF`/`OP_DNREFI` 7189.\n\n**Recursion** — `(?R)` 5210-5218 (`ERR58` if no `)`/`(`); `(?1)`/`(?0)` 5238-5252; `(?+1)`/`(?-1)` 5224-5236 (`ERR29` if no digit at 5232); `(?&name)`/`(?P>name)` 5257-5263; `\\g<n>`/`\\g'n'` 3757-3775 (numeric recursion, `ERR119` if unterminated); with args `(?1(a,b))` 5273-5279 → `parse_capture_list` (2732-2852). Codegen `META_RECURSE` 8182-8249, `META_RECURSE_BYNAME` 7123. Offset fixup pass at 11017-11060 with `RSCAN_CACHE_SIZE 8` (11015).\n\n**Conditionals** — all under `case CHAR_LEFT_PARENTHESIS` 5428:\n`(?(?=…)…)`/`(?(?C1)(?=…)…)` → `META_COND_ASSERT` 5440-5446 (`expect_cond_assert=2`; enforced 4791-4796 → **ERR28**; codegen 6844-6851); `(?(1)…)` `META_COND_NUMBER` 5450-5464 (`i<=0` → **ERR15**; codegen 6807-6827); `(?(VERSION>=10.0)…)` `META_COND_VERSION` 5466-5517 (**ERR79**; codegen 6829-6842); `(?(DEFINE)…)` 5556-5557 (codegen 6798-680